{"id":"n74121-3-7","stage":1,"title":"할아버지 · 爷爷","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74121-3-7-1","ko":"승규야, 그 과자는 어디서 난 거니?","zh":"承奎，那个饼干是从哪儿来的呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과자는","meaning":"饼干","explanation":"과자：饼干；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18286","senseId":"1","lemma":"과자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"来，有","explanation":"나다：来，有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"14","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"8cbae77b051c729e","term":"과자","zh":"饼干","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3","entryId":"18286","definition":"把牛奶、白糖等放入面粉或米粉中搅拌后烤制或油炸而成的零食。","pronunciation":["과자"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"来，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现原本没有的钱财或东西。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2965e898d84233d8443.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74121-3-7-2","ko":"가겟집 할아버지께서 주신 거예요.","zh":"是杂货店的老爷爷给我们的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가겟집","meaning":"店面，店家","explanation":"가겟집：店面，店家","readings":[{"term":"가겟집","audio":"/audio/3445aff6518d9003b821.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15032","senseId":"1","lemma":"가겟집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할아버지께서","meaning":"爷爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"3","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주신","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3445aff6518d9003","term":"가겟집","zh":"店面，店家","audio":"/audio/3445aff6518d9003b821.mp3","entryId":"15032","definition":"开店做生意的房子。","pronunciation":["가ː게찝","가ː겓찝"]},{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"(亲近)用于指称或称呼年老的男性。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/459c2c2a08aa5f38c6e5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.698,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74121","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.8562,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是杂货店的老爷爷给我们的。","承奎，那个饼干是从哪儿来的呀？","公告板上有新的通知贴出来吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎，那个饼干是从哪儿来的呀？","公告板上有新的通知贴出来吗？","是杂货店的老爷爷给我们的。"],"answer":2}]}
